<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <PackageId>X3Code.Infrastructure.Mobile</PackageId>
        <Product>X3Code.Infrastructure.Mobile</Product>
        <Title>X3-Code Infrastructure Mobile</Title>
        <Description>The X3Code repository pattern built against EF Core Sqlite, for mobile use</Description>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>10.0.0: New version scheme - the major now tracks the .NET generation the package is built for (net10.0), the minor carries features and breaking changes, the patch carries fixes. All X3Code packages move to 10.0.0 together.
Security: the native SQLite bundle is now pinned to SQLitePCLRaw.bundle_e_sqlite3 2.1.13. Entity Framework Core previously pulled in 2.1.11, which carries GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q (high severity).
The package now ships its XML documentation, and carries package metadata for the first time (id, title, description, license, icon, README).
Fixed malformed documentation tags on IRepository and GenericRepository.
Entity Framework Core 10.0.3 -> 10.0.11.
All asynchronous methods on IRepository/GenericRepository now take a CancellationToken and pass it down into Entity Framework, matching X3Code.Infrastructure. The parameter is optional, so existing call sites keep compiling.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore" />
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design">
          <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
          <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
        </PackageReference>
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite" />
        <!-- Hebt das native SQLite ueber die verwundbare 2.1.11 (GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q). -->
        <PackageReference Include="SQLitePCLRaw.bundle_e_sqlite3" />
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite.Core" />
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Tools">
          <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
          <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
        </PackageReference>
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>
